 ## Background
-The technique is used in the implementation described by Engel, Kraus & Ertl [S2, unofficial]. It applies the Phong reflection model to volume data rendered via texture mapping, aiming to provide visual cues for shape and depth in volume rendering [S1, S2, unofficial]. The Phong model components (ambient, diffuse, specular) are adapted from polygon shading to volume samples [S1, unofficial].
+The technique is used in the implementation described by Engel, Kraus & Ertl [S3, unofficial]. It applies the Phong reflection model to volume data rendered via texture mapping, aiming to provide visual cues for shape and depth in volume rendering [S1, S3, unofficial]. The Phong model components (ambient, diffuse, specular) are adapted from polygon shading to volume samples [S1, unofficial].
 
